  "spr_answers": [
    "40"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Slope: \\(\\frac{52 - 12}{10 - 0} = 4\\). The \\(y\\)-intercept is 12, so the line is \\(y = 4x + 12\\).",
    "When \\(x = 7\\): \\(y = 4(7) + 12 = 40\\)."
  ],
  "verify": "x = symbols('x')\nm = Rational(52 - 12, 10 - 0); f = m*x + 12\nassert simplify(f - sympify(figure['line'])) == 0\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == [f.subs(x, 7)] == [40]",
